Cell["\<\
vector \:4e0e covector \:7684 connection \:4f5c\:7528\:7b26\:53f7\:76f8\:53cd\
\:3002\:4ee5\:4e0b\:68c0\:67e5\:4fdd\:6301 xTensor \:539f\:59cb Riemann \
